OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and dry to start.
OL,6,FCloud increasing through the day, with
OL,7,Fa few light showers possible in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Breezy to start, especially
OL,9,Fnear coasts, then winds falling light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny lingering showers soon
OL,12,Fclearing this evening. Becoming dry
OL,13,Fwith some clear spells. Light winds
OL,14,Fthroughout. Feeling chilly, especially
OL,15,Fin rural spots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA dry but mostly cloudy
OL,18,Fstart. Outbreaks of rain spread
OL,19,Feastward later in the afternoon as
OL,20,Fwinds strengthen. Rain turning heavy
OL,21,Fat times in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
