OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and isolated showers Friday.
OL,7,FDry and bright Saturday, rain later.
OL,8,FPartly cloudy with isolated showers
OL,9,FSunday. Temperatures trending a little
OL,10,Fabove average.
